{"kind":"html","caption":"用第一行和第一列充当原地标记区，并额外保存“首行原本是否含 0”和“首列原本是否含 0”两个布尔状态。动画先扫描内部元素，把发现的 0 映射到对应的行首、列首，再依据这些标记清零内部区域，最后单独处理首行和首列。整个过程不需要额外矩阵，空间复杂度为 O(1)，时间复杂度为 O(mn)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>矩阵置零可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.content{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:start}\n@media(max-width:520px){.content{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.matrix{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,38px);gap:4px;justify-content:center}\n.matrix .cell{width:38px;min-height:38px;font-size:13px}\n.matrix .cell.marker{border-color:#3794ff;color:#8cc7ff;background:#173653}\n.matrix .cell.source{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.matrix .cell.zeroed{background:#202c35;color:#3794ff}\n.step{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.desc{font-size:12px;color:#8d8d8d;line-height:1.45;margin-top:4px;min-height:36px}\n.flags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin:6px 0}\n.flag{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.flag.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.legend{font-size:11px;color:#8d8d8d;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>矩阵自身作标记区</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 2：[[0,1,2,0],[3,4,5,2],[1,3,1,5]] · 额外空间 O(1)</p>\n<section class=\"content\">\n<div><div id=\"matrix\" class=\"matrix\"></div></div>\n<div>\n<div id=\"step\" class=\"step\"></div>\n<div id=\"desc\" class=\"desc\"></div>\n<div class=\"flags\"><span id=\"rowFlag\" class=\"flag\"></span><span id=\"colFlag\" class=\"flag\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><b class=\"accent\">首行</b>记列 · <b class=\"accent\">首列</b>记行；边界用两个布尔保存。</div>\n<div id=\"progress\" class=\"progress\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\n\nconst original=[[0,1,2,0],[3,4,5,2],[1,3,1,5]];\nconst phases=[\n {title:'① 保存边界状态',desc:'首行含 0，首列也含 0；先记住这两件事，之后第一行和第一列即可安全地充当标记区。',data:original,row:true,col:true,marks:[[0,0],[0,3]],sources:[[0,0],[0,3]]},\n {title:'② 扫描内部区域',desc:'只检查第 1 行、第 1 列之外的元素。本例内部没有新的 0，因此标记区保持不变。',data:original,row:true,col:true,marks:[[0,0],[0,3]],sources:[]},\n {title:'③ 按标记清零内部元素',desc:'第一行的第 3 列标记为 0，所以该列的内部元素变为 0；第一列的行标记目前没有新增项。',data:[[0,1,2,0],[3,4,5,0],[1,3,1,0]],row:true,col:true,marks:[[0,0],[0,3]],zeroed:[[1,3],[2,3]]},\n {title:'④ 单独处理首行与首列',desc:'两个边界状态都为真：清零整条首行，再清零整条首列，得到最终矩阵。',data:[[0,0,0,0],[0,4,5,0],[0,3,1,0]],row:true,col:true,marks:[],zeroed:[[0,0],[0,1],[0,2],[0,3],[1,0],[1,3],[2,0],[2,3]]},\n {title:'完成',desc:'输出 [[0,0,0,0],[0,4,5,0],[0,3,1,0]]。矩阵同时承担数据区和标记区的角色。',data:[[0,0,0,0],[0,4,5,0],[0,3,1,0]],row:true,col:true,marks:[],zeroed:[[0,0],[0,1],[0,2],[0,3],[1,0],[1,3],[2,0],[2,3]]}\n];\nconst matrix=document.getElementById('matrix'),step=document.getElementById('step'),desc=document.getElementById('desc'),rowFlag=document.getElementById('rowFlag'),colFlag=document.getElementById('colFlag'),progress=document.getElementById('progress');\nphases.forEach(()=>{const d=document.createElement('i');d.className='dot';progress.appendChild(d)});\nlet index=0;\nconst has=(list,r,c)=>(list||[]).some(p=>p[0]===r&&p[1]===c);\nfunction render(){const p=phases[index];matrix.innerHTML='';p.data.forEach((row,r)=>row.forEach((v,c)=>{const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='cell';el.textContent=v;if(has(p.marks,r,c))el.classList.add('marker');if(has(p.sources,r,c))el.classList.add('source');if(has(p.zeroed,r,c))el.classList.add('zeroed');matrix.appendChild(el)}));step.textContent=p.title;desc.textContent=p.desc;rowFlag.textContent='首行含 0：'+(p.row?'true':'false');colFlag.textContent='首列含 0：'+(p.col?'true':'false');rowFlag.classList.toggle('on',p.row);colFlag.classList.toggle('on',p.col);[...progress.children].forEach((d,i)=>d.classList.toggle('on',i===index));index=(index+1)%phases.length}\nrender();setInterval(render,2600);\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
